   104	///   `PeerId(pub u64)` is Send + Sync + Copy trivially (newtype
   105	///   around u64).  Composition: `FormatId: Send + Sync + Copy`
   106	///   (enum of all-Copy variants).  `Option<FormatId>` is Send + Sync.
   107	///   **No new Rule 4 trigger**; arc terminus stays at 6.
