   178	    /// into the tombstone tracker AND drop all existing snapshot
   179	    /// entries for that sheet from `last_snapshot`.  All subsequent
   180	    /// cell-keyed effects targeting the same sheet are silently
   181	    /// dropped (matching the V3.5.0.3b engine-replay tombstone
   182	    /// guard semantic, which the live cache walker previously
   183	    /// LACKED -- the leak surfaced as phantom entries in
   184	    /// `list_sheets_from_cache`).
   185	    RemoveSheet { id: u16 },
   186	    /// **V3.6.0.3 D2 (2026-05-24)**: session-wide format-table cache
